sequenceDiagram
    participant J as Glue driver
    participant S as S3 attempt data
    participant M as S3 commit key
    participant C as Consumer
    J->>M: Read existing logical-run commit
    alt Valid committed run exists
        M-->>J: Existing identity and output locations
    else No committed run
        J->>S: Write unique attempt datasets
        J->>J: Validate counts and complete Glue bookkeeping
        J->>M: Put commit with If-None-Match star
        alt Commit race lost
            M-->>J: Existing commit, validate exact logical identity
        end
    end
    C->>M: Read commit
    C->>S: Read only datasets referenced by commit
